    "description": {
      "value": "Though many Bekyars worship demons, you seek to pave a different path for yourself and your kindred, while also attempting to change other Mwangi's treatment of your culture.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Abyss Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Group Impression skill feat."
